;: tbuf.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: 3-state buffers and Longline pull-ups
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk FC
Base FG
Config X:F Y:G F:A G:B DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A
Equate G = ~B
Endblk
Editblk FH
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = A*B
Endblk
Editblk P23
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P24
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P25
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P26
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P27
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P65
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Addnet D0 P23.I FC.A
Addnet D1 P24.I FC.B
Addnet T0 P25.I TBUF.FB.1.T
Addnet T1 P26.I TBUF.FE.1.T TBUF.FD.2.T
Addnet X0 FC.X TBUF.FB.1.I
Addnet X1 FC.Y TBUF.FE.1.I
Addnet X2 P27.I TBUF.FD.2.I
Addnet BUS1 TBUF.FB.1.O TBUF.FE.1.O PU.FA.1.O FH.A
Addnet BUS2 TBUF.FD.2.O PU.FM.2.O FH.B
Addnet OUT FH.X P65.O
